anyfile-to-markdown (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Major rewrite: ConvertPdfToMarkdown → AnyFileToMarkdown.
  * New engine: MarkItDown by Microsoft (multi-format support).
  * New GUI: format auto-detection + dynamic options per format.
  * Supported formats: PDF, PPTX, DOCX, XLSX, images, HTML, EPUB, CSV, JSON, XML, ZIP, audio.
  * Opcional PyMuPDF4LLM fallback for advanced PDF settings.
  * Updated packaging for Debian 13 (trixie).

 -- stas <stas@example.com>  Thu, 30 Jul 2026 14:10:22 +0200

